WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.400
Here's what done looks like.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:05.629
Every internet-facing endpoint
is behind a WAF in prevention,

3
00:00:05.629 --> 00:00:07.288
or has a decision record.

4
00:00:07.288 --> 00:00:11.975
Every policy's rule set is the version
the application owner validated.

5
00:00:11.975 --> 00:00:16.250
The plan file was reviewed with the
application owner before anyone ran it.

6
00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:20.350
And every endpoint's WAF logs
reach the platform workspace.

7
00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:26.260
Next, Chapter 5: a WAF only helps if
nothing can reach the origin around it.
